          "title": "You'll want to know: descolar",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "descolar — \"to take off (of a plane); to come unstuck\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "O avião descolou com meia hora de atraso. The plane took off half an hour late."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In Brazil: decolar. A sticker that comes off also descola."
